WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:05.420
Every dollar in your wallet is a death certificate with a president's face on it.

2
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:10.840
I know that sounds dramatic. It isn't. It's actually underselling it.

3
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:18.040
The Problem: Every Fiat Currency in History Has Been Devalued To Fund Unpopular Wars.

4
00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:26.500
Here's a fun historical pattern that definitely won't repeat itself (it will): Revolutionary France (seventeen nineties).

5
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:35.600
Started wars with everyone. Ran out of money. Printed "assignats" backed by stolen church land.

6
00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:43.200
Hyperinflation: thirteen thousand percent in five years. Napoleon happened (not great).

7
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:50.820
Weimar Germany (nineteen twenties). Lost World War One. Printed money to pay reparations.

8
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:56.200
Hyperinflation: twenty-nine thousand five hundred percent per month.

9
00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:02.140
People burned money for heat. Hitler happened (really not great).

10
00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:09.360
United States (nineteen seventeen to the present). Created Federal Reserve (nineteen thirteen).

11
00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:17.020
Immediately funded World War One (nineteen seventeen). Dollar lost ninety-six percent of value since.

12
00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:22.720
Wars now continuous and everywhere. You're living it (how's that working out?).

13
00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:30.980
The pattern is so consistent it's basically a law of physics: give politicians a money printer, they will use it to kill

14
00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:35.740
people. Every time. Without exception. For thousands of years.

15
00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:42.760
You invented money to trade chickens more efficiently. Within a few centuries, you were using it to incinerate cities.

16
00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:50.720
Remarkable species. Nineteen seventy-two: When Nixon Weaponized Money Against You.

17
00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:57.820
August fifteenth, nineteen seventy-one. The day your money stopped meaning anything and nobody told you.

18
00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:06.250
Nixon went on T.V. and said, in slightly more presidential language, "Remember how dollars could be exchanged for gold?

19
00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:11.060
We're stopping that. Also, wage and price controls. Also, import taxes."

20
00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:20.260
He called it a "New Economic Policy." On your planet, when someone names a policy the opposite of what it does, something

21
00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:26.840
